Package: breacher
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Vaizer0
Depends: git, python, python-pip
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Vaizer0/zero-termux
Description: Multi-threaded URL brute-forcer for hidden paths
 Breacher is a fast, multi-threaded tool for brute-forcing hidden
 directories and files on web servers using custom wordlists.
